<sect1 id="chapter4_1autotoc_md112_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter4_1autotoc_md112">
<title>Compatibility helper</title><para>The helper accepts an ABI version and returns nonzero for compatibility. Call it before solver use in adapters and module loaders. Avoid duplicating version checks in multiple places.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">SattyreSolverInfo<sp/>info<sp/>=<sp/>sattyre_solver_info();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">if<sp/>(!sattyre_solver_abi_compatible(info.abi_version))<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>fprintf(stderr,<sp/>&quot;Incompatible<sp/>solver<sp/>ABI:<sp/>%u\n&quot;,<sp/>info.abi_version);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>1;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
