<sect1 id="chapter4_1autotoc_md114_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter4_1autotoc_md114">
<title>Result codes</title><para><computeroutput><ref refid="Sattyre-Solver_8h_1a69d5cd50d36d2c32d1e00c4790f9f1f7" kindref="member">SattyreSolverResult</ref></computeroutput> maps to SAT, UNSAT, UNKNOWN. Adapters should map these exactly to <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacesattyre_1ade8a7fe1106cbadebc9b9695bf57c096" kindref="member">sattyre::SolveResult</ref></computeroutput>. Unknown must remain distinguishable from failure paths.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>Keep<sp/>Unknown<sp/>for<sp/>indeterminate<sp/>or<sp/>unsupported<sp/>cases.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>Do<sp/>not<sp/>repurpose<sp/>it<sp/>as<sp/>a<sp/>generic<sp/>error<sp/>bucket.</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
