<sect1 id="chapter4_1autotoc_md116_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter4_1autotoc_md116">
<title>ABI tests</title><para>A dedicated solver ABI test should verify version and metadata fields. Compatibility helper should be checked with current and mismatched versions. C and C++ surfaces should agree on results.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>-S<sp/>.<sp/>-B<sp/>build/abi<sp/>-DSATTYRE_ENABLE_TESTS=ON</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>--build<sp/>build/abi<sp/>-j</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ctest<sp/>--test-dir<sp/>build/abi<sp/>-R<sp/>sattyre-solver-abi-test<sp/>--output-on-failure</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
